---
import { cta } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="about" class="py-6 sm:py-10">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="r grid items-center gap-8 border border-line bg-card p-5 sm:p-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] lg:gap-12 lg:p-10">
      <img data-reveal src="/annette-fernholz.jpg" alt="Attorney Portrait" width="960" height="960" loading="lazy" class="mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-xs rounded-2xl object-cover object-[50%_25%] lg:max-w-none" />
      <div data-reveal style="--i:1">
        <p class="chip">About the Attorney</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.25rem)] leading-tight">A Legacy of Exacting Precision</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-muted">
          <p>I serve clients who are facing complex, high-stakes appeals involving divorce, child custody, and significant property division. Over the course of my career, I have handled numerous appeals, argued before the Illinois Supreme Court and lectured on appellate issues.</p>
          <p>Because I am an experienced litigator, I bring an objective perspective to every case. I am frequently consulted by trial attorneys to preserve the record or help frame closing arguments or motions to consider when an appellate strategy is the only path forward.</p>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-page p-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug">
          “Appeals aren't won with emotion. They are won through strategic application of the law, dissecting a complete record, and persuasive legal writing.”
        </blockquote>
        <a href={cta.href} class="btn btn-accent mt-6">{cta.label}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
